# Leo works across a Mac and a Windows PC. Without this, git hands each
# machine a different set of line endings for the same file, and anything
# that reads a file's bytes — the styles.css cache-bust hash in build.js,
# for one — produces different output per platform. Normalise to LF in the
# repo and on checkout so a build is the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
